{
  "id": "471",
  "title": "Do you have WeChat?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-03-01",
  "synopsis": "Little Yu wants to add Ben to her friends list on WeChat.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/670/e02fe792544af6c7a65765acf8fb5199c2cef23a.mp3?1589791604",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 3: Who is Little Yu?",
    "chapter": 6,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你有微信吗？\n\n小雨：本，你有微信吗？\n本：有。\n小雨：我可以加你吗？\n本：好啊。\n小雨：是你扫我，还是我扫你？\n本：你扫我吧。\n小雨：好了。你加我为好友吧。\n本：好的。",
    "traditional": "你有微信嗎？\n\n小雨：本，你有微信嗎？\n本：有。\n小雨：我可以加你嗎？\n本：好啊。\n小雨：是你掃我，還是我掃你？\n本：你掃我吧。\n小雨：好了。你加我為好友吧。\n本：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you have WeChat?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小雨：本，你有微信吗？",
