      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Sure."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小雨：是你扫我，还是我扫你？",
      "traditional": "小雨：是你掃我，還是我掃你？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ shì nǐ sǎo wǒ hái shi wǒ sǎo nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Will you swipe me, or should I swipe you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：你扫我吧。",
      "traditional": "本：你掃我吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ sǎo wǒ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
